# Local project documentation

Keep actual documents and assets locally in these locations:

- docs/: project documentation, local setup notes, and integration summaries
- docs/academic/: presentations and internship reports
- docs/assets/: architecture diagrams
- docs/reference/: reference PDFs

The report generator optionally uses
`docs/assets/block diagram-full architecture.png` and skips it if absent.

The tracked root README.md contains the complete application setup instructions.
Copy this template to docs/README.md if you want a local documentation index.
